(The variance is a rounding artefact: treas reports 100,000,000.25 while the other two sources agree on 100,000,000.00.  The highest-salience non-named contributor is CashPosition!B7, whose value moved by 0.25 since the prior period.  Rounding treas to the 0-decimal precision of the consensus closes the 0.25 difference, so the reconciliation passes once the rounded figure is booked.  The proposal is applied in the scratch sheet only; treas is not modified.) Tj
