98.4 693 48 15 re W n
BT
0 0 0 rg
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 99.9 696.92 Tm
(The difference is structural, not a rounding artefact: rounding acct to the 0-decimal precision of the consensus changes it by 0.00 and leaves 250,000.00 open.  The highest-salience non-named contributor is Monthly!J8, whose value moved by 250,000.00 since the prior period - the movement is the difference itself.  The agent therefore books the reconciling item the prior period used most often for this account - Revolver draw booked by Treasury but not yet by Accounting \(proposed by the close agent; the most frequent item of the prior period, 9 occurrence\(s\)\) - for 250,000.00, and re-reconciles the account with it.  The source workbooks stay untouched; the proposal lives in the scratch sheet.) Tj
ET
Q
